        "data": {
          "text": "Kunin et al. (2021) — Symmetry & Broken Conservation Laws\nVGG-11 + CIFAR-10 (Conv+BN+ReLU → all 3 symmetries)\n\nPaper observables:\n  Eq 18 Translation: FC classifier column sums (no sum op available)\n  Eq 19 Scale: BN parameter L2 norms → wl2(global) tracks all BN layers\n  Eq 20 Rescale: Conv layer norm differences (needs per-layer tracking)\n\nwl2: weight L2 norm — Eq 19 scale symmetry proxy\ngnorm: gradient norm — drives Eq 19/20 integral terms\n\nChange SGD lr/wd, Train, compare curves.\nη=0.1 λ=0 (baseline) → λ=5e-4 → λ=0.01",
          "instanceTitle": "Guide"
        },
        "parentId": null,
        "extent": null,
